{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左手持二金剛寶如十字著，右手仰舒下垂作施印，想心月輪中􌹡得浪字\n放黃色光，一念變成寶生佛，左手持二金剛寶，右手結施印，即誦寶生心密言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○次想二金剛寶，出生無盡諸天如意珍寶，即以二手十字相持，\n向曼荼外圍右旋，出生珍寶，間錯莊嚴，隨誦寶錯真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○觀法性空○心壇現空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○觀法性空，止觀二羽當胸虛心合掌，如未敷蓮華，誦性空真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於空性中想􌥣𠽾𠾐（二合）字，成虛空金剛心曼荼羅，即誦佛寶閣真言與三金\n剛真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "表白清音，朗宣觀意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即緊振鈴，誦因緣咒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "切身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舌齒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合口"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "少略靜住，可進湯飲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○皈依發心○修施法供○回向三寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此去引偈表白提舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○上奉三寶○下施六道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○入壇請聖○修明智行○啟告本事○奉申供養"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以二羽內相叉，進力並伸直，忍願纏進力初節前峰各相拄，禪\n智並伸直，當心默誦真言七遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
